{"words": [{"text": "فَقُلْنَا", "translation": "So We said"}, {"text": "ٱضْرِبُوهُ", "translation": "Strike him"}, {"text": "بِبَعْضِهَا ۚ", "translation": "with a part of it"}, {"text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "Like this"}, {"text": "يُحْىِ", "translation": "revives"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ", "translation": "the dead"}, {"text": "وَيُرِيكُمْ", "translation": "and shows you"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ", "translation": "His Signs"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translation": "perhaps you may"}, {"text": "تَعْقِلُونَ", "translation": "use your intellect"}], "sahih": "So We said, \"Strike him [i.e., the slain man] with part of it.\"1 Thus does Allāh bring the dead to life, and He shows you His signs that you might reason."}